# Mirrored contract artifacts with pinned checksums.
# The cloud copy of the agent gateway contract must stay byte-identical to the
# firmware copy, which is the authority: `manifest.json` pins `schema_sha256`
# against it and the firmware build fails a configure on a mismatch. Prettier
# reflows this schema inline-object style, which would silently break the pin
# while looking like a formatting change.
contracts/agent-gateway-v0/
